WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
09:00 — Bank list. He reviews AED, GBP and PKR accounts in one scroll — favourites pin the accounts he checks daily.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.000
11:30 — Dashboard. Net worth rolls up in one dashboard so he knows whether to move cash before a client pays late.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:19.500
17:45 — Encrypted backup. Before a new iPhone arrives he exports a .vos backup to Files — restore is a guided flow on the next device.

00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:26.000
20:10 — Security check. He confirms PIN and encryption settings — the vault never leaves the device unless he chooses to export.

